      content: 'After your private conversation with the patient, you invite her parents into the room. Her father immediately says: "She is not ready to go away to college. She has never been on her own. What if her shunt malfunctions? What if she gets a UTI and can\'t get to a doctor? I\'ve been taking care of her since the day she was born. It\'s too dangerous." The patient looks at you with pleading eyes.',
